On #TheAmanpourHour this week:
• Bill McKibben on climate solutions as wildfires scorch Europe;
• The exhibit imagining if Emmett Till had lived, with curator @sarahelizalewis &amp; Till’s cousin Rev. Wheeler Parker Jr;
• Dave Eggers talks AI fears &amp; new novel “Contrapposto”.

